There is another option! go into defaults.nh and find the line:

OPTIONS=map_mode:<something>

and comment it out and place:

OPTIONs=map_mode:ascii8x12

below it.

You can now use the graphical version but the graphics will be of the
characters you would see in text mode.

This allows you to have a scrollable log and other nice icons, but
still get all the information you would get in text mode.

I play in text mode.



